      "<strong>Theorem:</strong> $\\mathcal{F}_{1D}\\{p_\\theta\\}(\\rho)=F(\\rho\\cos\\theta,\\,\\rho\\sin\\theta)$, a <strong>radial slice</strong> of the 2D spectrum.",
